========================================================================
KINGUARDIAN - FULL ARCHITECTURE & END-TO-END VERIFICATION MANUAL
========================================================================

Architecture Overview:
- Mobile Frontend: React Native (Expo) - `kinguardian-mobile` (Metro Bundler)
- Backend: FastAPI / Python 3.12 - `kinguardian-backend` (Docker container / port 8000)
- Database: PostgreSQL 16 - `kinguardian-postgres` (Docker container / port 5432)

------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DOCKER & CONTAINER MANAGEMENT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Check docker version and running containers:
  docker ps
  docker start kinguardian-postgres
  docker start kinguardian-backend

Check ports:
  docker port kinguardian-postgres   -> 0.0.0.0:5432
  docker port kinguardian-backend    -> 0.0.0.0:8000

Health Check:
  curl http://localhost:8000/health
  Response: {"status":"ok"}

Swagger API Documentation:
  http://localhost:8000/docs

Connect to PostgreSQL Database CLI:
  docker exec -it kinguardian-postgres psql -U kinguardian -d kinguardian
